  "sourceTitle": "Mocha Frappe",
  "sourceText": "Mocha Frappe\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, February 12, 2010 - 9:11pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup nonfat milk\nctn soft tofu - (14 oz carton)\n1 tablespoon instant espresso powder\n2 tablespoons cocoa\ncup sugar\nteaspoon vanilla\nteaspoon almond extract\ncup ice cubes\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix milk, tofu, espresso powder, cocoa, sugar, vanilla and almond extract in a blender until smooth. Add ice cubes and blend again to chop fine. Serve cold. 2 This recipe yields 2 servings. 3 NOTES :",
